WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.292 --> 00:00:05.293
"This is going to be the best field trip ever!"

2
00:00:05.313 --> 00:00:06.114
Ben said.

3
00:00:29.932 --> 00:00:32.134
He was sitting next to Winnie on the school bus.

4
00:00:32.154 --> 00:00:36.557
"I guess it will be interesting," Winnie murmured.

5
00:00:36.577 --> 00:00:39.779
"I've never been to People Place before.

6
00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:44.542
My parents say that many people don't like witches.

7
00:00:46.223 --> 00:00:47.604
Or any kind of monsters."

8
00:00:49.105 --> 00:00:50.887
Ben knew Winnie was very nervous.

9
00:00:52.548 --> 00:00:55.250
Other students on the school bus seemed nervous too.

10
00:00:57.351 --> 00:01:00.873
So did Miss Bungle, the broom-flying teacher, and Mr.

11
00:01:00.933 --> 00:01:07.097
Freaky. The principal was running up and down the bus aisle, warning everybody to behave.

12
00:01:07.117 --> 00:01:12.880
"Remember, students, this field trip is very important.

13
00:01:13.861 --> 00:01:17.243
We're going to be camping overnight at the People Place Museum.

14
00:01:17.743 --> 00:01:19.424
And you know what Mayor Hubbletree said.

15
00:01:19.844 --> 00:01:25.288
If monsters create any problems, he's going to consider tearing down Monster Academy again."

16
00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:28.640
"No problem, Mr.

17
00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:32.982
Freaky," Mog said, blowing a slime ball at a skeleton.

18
00:01:38.123 --> 00:01:40.644
know me—I always behave."

19
00:01:41.204 --> 00:01:44.405
"Don't worry, Winnie," Ben said.

20
00:01:44.425 --> 00:01:46.686
"People are just like monsters.

21
00:01:47.026 --> 00:01:48.226
They only look strange."

22
00:01:49.166 --> 00:01:50.026
Winnie laughed.

23
00:01:51.147 --> 00:01:51.967
"I guess you're right.

24
00:01:52.407 --> 00:01:55.068
Everything went well when the people came to Monster Academy.

25
00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:00.661
And Jen is dating a person."

26
00:02:00.681 --> 00:02:03.944
"Yep," said Ben.

27
00:02:03.964 --> 00:02:06.186
"Jen is still dating Dave."

28
00:02:07.587 --> 00:02:09.548
Mr. Freaky was wringing his hands.

29
00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:13.271
His three noses wiggled like mad.

30
00:02:14.532 --> 00:02:18.135
"Students, Miss Bungle is going to start collecting permission slips.

31
00:02:18.596 --> 00:02:23.379
Please have yours ready—along with your monster manners and best behavior."

32
00:02:28.344 --> 00:02:32.787
"Permission slip, please," Miss Bungle said to a three-eyed monster.

33
00:02:33.747 --> 00:02:35.828
The monster handed her the slip of paper.

34
00:02:36.449 --> 00:02:39.850
Miss Bungle took it and then moved to the monsters in the next seat.

35
00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:45.093
"I hope that you all remembered to pack food in your lunchboxes," Mr.

36
00:02:45.133 --> 00:02:45.794
Freaky said.

37
00:02:45.814 --> 00:02:48.115
"We'll be eating dinner at the museum."

38
00:02:48.135 --> 00:02:51.237
"I remembered," said a goblin.

39
00:02:51.257 --> 00:02:54.959
"I brought my own food because people eat weird stuff.

40
00:02:56.039 --> 00:02:58.040
Here's my lunchbox."

41
00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:00.601
He held up a big metal pail filled with slime.

42
00:03:00.621 --> 00:03:05.122
"Uh-oh," said an octopus monster.

43
00:03:05.142 --> 00:03:08.043
"I probably didn't bring enough food."

44
00:03:08.983 --> 00:03:12.244
She gazed sadly at the two barrels of fish beside her.

45
00:03:12.264 --> 00:03:15.245
"That's okay," said a ghoul.

46
00:03:15.265 --> 00:03:18.246
"I brought enough dead rats for everyone!"

47
00:03:22.267 --> 00:03:25.628
everyone bring a sleeping bag—or whatever you sleep in?"

48
00:03:25.988 --> 00:03:26.568
asked Mr.

49
00:03:26.608 --> 00:03:31.945
Freaky. "I brought my camping coffin," said a vampire.

50
00:03:31.965 --> 00:03:38.727
"I packed my portable pyramid," said a mummy girl named Cleo.

51
00:03:39.747 --> 00:03:43.028
Waldo, who was sitting across from Cleo, grinned at her.

52
00:03:44.469 --> 00:03:48.210
But Ben saw Gaby, sitting on the other side of Waldo, frown.

53
00:03:51.911 --> 00:03:56.272
and Cleo have been spending a lot of time together," Ben whispered to Winnie.

54
00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:59.001
"I think Gaby's a little jealous."

55
00:03:59.021 --> 00:04:04.962
"Waldo told me Cleo is helping him learn Egyptian magic," Winnie replied.

56
00:04:04.982 --> 00:04:09.143
"That's cool," Ben said.

57
00:04:09.163 --> 00:04:12.584
"I hope we'll see some stuff from Egypt in the museum."

58
00:04:17.366 --> 00:04:22.927
"Mr. Freaky, I have all the permission slips," Miss Bungle announced a few minutes later.

59
00:04:22.947 --> 00:04:25.728
"Then I guess we're ready to go."

60
00:04:26.788 --> 00:04:29.589
Mr. Freaky loosened his tie and swallowed hard.

61
00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:35.570
The driver turned the ignition key.

62
00:04:39.171 --> 00:04:43.853
A shriek came from the engine, followed by some coughing sounds and black smoke.

63
00:04:45.453 --> 00:04:46.073
"We're off!"

64
00:04:46.493 --> 00:04:47.093
Ben said.

65
00:04:50.935 --> 00:04:56.296
The monsters laughed and talked as the bus drove through the familiar streets of Monsterville.

66
00:04:57.888 --> 00:05:03.713
The kids played games, and the doppelgangers changed shape a bunch of times to amuse everybody.

67
00:05:06.295 --> 00:05:11.459
But the laughter faded as the bus approached the wall that separated Monsterville from People Place.

68
00:05:11.479 --> 00:05:14.842
"Now, don't worry, students!"

69
00:05:15.302 --> 00:05:16.523
Mr. Freaky called out.

70
00:05:16.543 --> 00:05:20.267
"Remember, we have permission to visit People Place.

71
00:05:20.687 --> 00:05:23.669
And we are Mayor Hubbletree's special guests!"

72
00:05:27.996 --> 00:05:35.020
All the monsters—even the zombies—held their breath as the bus slowly traveled through the gate in the wall.

73
00:05:42.224 --> 00:05:43.565
It's so bright here!"

74
00:05:44.085 --> 00:05:44.865
moaned a ghoul.

75
00:05:44.885 --> 00:05:47.767
"Yeah," said a vampire.

76
00:05:47.787 --> 00:05:50.388
"Is it always this sunny?"

77
00:05:50.408 --> 00:05:54.410
"It's a little creepy," said a skeleton.

78
00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:57.132
"Do I look like a person now?"

79
00:05:57.616 --> 00:05:58.396
asked Carly.

80
00:05:59.217 --> 00:06:02.097
She had changed her face to try to imitate a person.

81
00:06:03.158 --> 00:06:05.698
But her nose and eyes were in the wrong places.

82
00:06:06.779 --> 00:06:08.399
Everyone laughed uneasily.

83
00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:14.861
saw Winnie sit up straight and clutch her broom.

84
00:06:17.302 --> 00:06:18.402
He squeezed her hand.

85
00:06:18.422 --> 00:06:21.403
"Don't worry," he reassured her.

86
00:06:21.423 --> 00:06:23.183
"This trip will be a blast.

87
00:06:23.503 --> 00:06:25.504
We'll see cool stuff and have fun."

88
00:06:26.696 --> 00:06:27.436
Winnie nodded.

89
00:06:28.337 --> 00:06:30.378
The broomstick was shaking in her hand.

90
00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:38.481
almost at the museum," announced Mr.

91
00:06:38.541 --> 00:06:39.581
Freaky a minute later.

92
00:06:43.063 --> 00:06:47.785
The bus drove past a huge building with two large stone lions out front.

93
00:06:47.805 --> 00:06:49.666
"It's the museum!"

94
00:06:49.866 --> 00:06:50.466
Gaby said.

95
00:06:50.486 --> 00:06:53.447
"Cool. The building looks pretty old."

96
00:06:53.467 --> 00:06:59.199
"Yeah! Like a beautiful crypt," said a vampire.

97
00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.741
Ben waited for the bus to stop.

98
00:07:02.722 --> 00:07:06.165
Instead it pulled around to a lot in the back of the building.

99
00:07:08.928 --> 00:07:10.789
Mr. Freaky sprang out of his seat.

100
00:07:12.471 --> 00:07:13.171
"Here we are!"

101
00:07:13.552 --> 00:07:14.052
he called.

102
00:07:14.072 --> 00:07:18.116
"Our field trip in People Place is about to begin!"
